~ start
do Gs._stop()
Narrator: You should meet your new colleagues
set Gs.event = "meeting"
do Gs._play()
=> END

~ meet
do Gs._stop()
Director: We are late with the execution of the plan! Everyone speed up 1003 times!
secretary: But today is the first working day!
Analyst: If we start right now, we will overtake our competitors in just 152 years.
Deputy Director: Exactly! all for the shawarma!
Economist: 17 times a day?! It will bankrupt the...
accountant: At my expense!
The guard: I won't believe you!
the accountant: Damn! I forgot that I have no money!
Manager: And when is the salary?
Director: The ruble has fallen!
Richard: I see.
Director: Let's get to work!
=> end_meet
=> END

~ end_meet
Narrator: That's the end of the meeting, and the assignment for today is on your screen.
do vis()
do Gs._play()
=> END